sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Client App
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant Cache as Cache Layer
    participant DB as Primary Database

    Client->>API: Request project summary for the selected workspace
    activate API
    opt Cache hit
        API->>Cache: Read cached summary payload
        activate Cache
        Cache-->>API: Return cached summary payload
        deactivate Cache
        API-->>Client: Return cached summary response immediately
    end

    loop Poll until report generation is complete or timeout budget is exhausted
        API->>DB: Read latest report status and completion metadata
        activate DB
        DB-->>API: Return current report state for the active request
        deactivate DB
    end

    API-->>Client: Return final report summary and last known progress state
    deactivate API
